+
+The AI chip sector closed out the week of August 24–28 in orderly fashion, maintaining the massive gains secured during Thursday's session. Nvidia held steady around the $227 level while Broadcom finished unchanged at $368.79. The broader technology tape demonstrated resilience as institutional investors digested full quarterly metrics.
+
+## What moved
+
+| Name | Change | Note |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| NVDA | -0.19% | Held onto post-earnings surge, closing week firmly above $227 |
+| AVGO | 0.00% | Flatted out at $368.79 as traders consolidated recent gains ahead of month-end |
