+
+Following a volatile week driven by macro positioning and Tier-1 earnings, markets entered a natural consolidation phase. Portfolio managers rebalanced exposure while confirming that fundamental AI hardware tailwinds remain intact across all sub-sectors.
+
+## The number behind it
+
+Nvidia's quarterly net income reached $120.07 billion on a trailing twelve-month basis, representing a net margin profile near 55%. This unprecedented profitability level continues to fund massive ongoing R&D expenditures in next-generation architectures.
+
+## What to watch
+
+Focus now shifts to September semiconductor trade shows, Broadcom's upcoming Q3 earnings cycle, and updated supply allocation updates from foundry partners.

